## Installation

Clone the collection, then fetch the members:

```bash
git submodule update --init
```

Each member is an independent repository pinned as a submodule - members publish
in their own repositories first, then the collection re-pins.

## Usage

Activate the collection through your agent environment's skill mechanism:

```text
use {{collection-name}}
```

A memberless task is matched against every member whose description covers it -
several members may work together. Name a member directly to use it alone.

